PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52WL

   1 a 0000 E52WL: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006 
   3 a 0006    /* E52WL probe (PLAN sec P3-10 extra boundary): the
   4 a 0006       manual's own example form SIGNAL ENDFILE with NO
